    "sections": {
        "description": "Summer Program Theme features a structured and responsive design intended for sharing seasonal activities, schedules, announcements, and informational content. The theme includes customizable homepage sections, banner areas, call-to-action blocks, and media support for images and videos. Its layout is optimized for organized content presentation across different screen sizes. The theme provides flexible customization settings for colors, typography, navigation menus, and widget areas. It also supports gallery sections, contact information blocks, and integrated social media links for improved communication and accessibility. Built with standard coding practices, the theme maintains compatibility with current browsers and commonly used plugins. The overall design focuses on readability, simple navigation, and consistent spacing to help present program details clearly. Additional layout settings allow users to modify headers, footers, and section arrangements through the built-in customization panel."
    },
